This isn't really a ggplot question, you have a problem with your data
and you need to clean it up before plotting. The reason removing the
points didn't work is because you removed the "wrong wrong points":

ES_all  <- ES_all[-c(87:89),] ##to remove rows, de-# if needed

You need to go back and figure out why you have those duplicate
values, determine which ones are correct, and fix the problem before
you plot.

Best,
Ista

